/**
 * @defgroup jetos_types Data Structures
 *
 * The structures, unions, enums and typedefs of the component, each in the
 * section of its name: the structures and unions, then the typedefs, then the
 * enums. A type defined under the same name for x86_64 and for arm64 (each in
 * its own file) is documented once, with the fields of both definitions, each
 * marked with its architecture (x86_64: or arm64:): Doxygen keeps one type per
 * name.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup jetos_macros Macro Definitions
 *
 * The macros of the component (those of the include guards aside), each
 * in the section of its name.
 */
